<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Thank you for joining The City of Columbus Office of Diversity and Inclusion at our Business Networking Event on October 5th. Your attendance truly made a difference and contributed to its success.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">We would also like to thank The City of Columbus representatives, Shellee Fisher Photography, and our exhibitors: Creating Central Ohio Futures, Dehan Enterprises Insurance &amp; Financial Services, Elford Construction, Gilbane Building Company, Ascension Construction Solutions, Saturn Partners LLC, Economic and Community Development Institute (ECDI), Adephi Bank, National Skilled Trades Network, and Bricker Graydon LLP.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Last but not least, a special thank you to The Columbus Crew for hosting us in the Huntington Field Club at Lower.com Field.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">We look forward to seeing you at our future networking events!</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Stay connected with us: <a href="https://new.columbus.gov/diversity?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" title="ODI website link" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00529B;">new.columbus.gov/diversity</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Sincerely,</p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2023/10/8340019/5016846/jtjsignatureblue-original_crop.png" style="width: 133px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="JTJsignature" width="133" height="116"><p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 1em 0 15px;">Jason Jenkins<br>Chief Diversity Officer<br>&amp; The ODI Team</p>
